---
kind: lore
id: revisits
title: Coming back to a room
---

<beat id="lobby" on="enter" target="room.lobby" once="false">
  @narrator{code="0010"}: The lobby. The wheelchair is facing the room now.
  @narrator{code="0020" when="run.power"}: Under the new light the map of the ward is legible: YOU ARE HERE, and a red dot scratched out.
  @narrator{code="0030" when="holds('canEnter', ['surgery'])"}: Down the east corridor, the surgery doors are lit.
</beat>

<beat id="reception" on="enter" target="room.reception" once="false">
  @narrator{code="0010"}: Reception. The switchboard cords have been plugged back in, every one of them, into the wrong holes.
</beat>

<beat id="chapel" on="enter" target="room.chapel" once="false">
  <match subject="run.bellRung">
    <when is="true">
      @narrator{code="0010"}: The chapel. The pews have turned back to face the altar.
    </when>
    <otherwise>
      @narrator{code="0020"}: The chapel. The pews still face the door. The rope hangs, waiting for three.
    </otherwise>
  </match>
</beat>

<beat id="childrensWard" on="enter" target="room.childrensWard" once="false">
  @narrator{code="0010"}: The children's ward. Eleven mattresses. Someone has straightened the blankets.
  @child{code="0010" os when="@shaken"}: You came back. Nobody comes back.
</beat>

<beat id="hydro" on="enter" target="room.hydro" once="false">
  /* a fact cannot be a <match> subject: an if/else on one is two guarded lines */
  @narrator{code="0010" when="holds('solved', ['hydroValves'])"}: Hydrotherapy. The empty tub drips. The canvas lids are all buckled shut again.
  @narrator{code="0020" when="!holds('solved', ['hydroValves'])"}: Hydrotherapy. The black water, the brass key, the patient valves.
</beat>

<beat id="pharmacy" on="enter" target="room.pharmacy" once="false">
  @narrator{code="0010"}: The pharmacy. Every bottle has been turned to face the wall.
</beat>

<beat id="records" on="enter" target="room.records" once="false">
  @narrator{code="0010"}: Records. A new drawer is open. You didn't open it.
</beat>

<beat id="morgue" on="enter" target="room.morgue" once="false">
  @narrator{code="0010"}: The morgue. The gurney in the middle of the floor has been made up, sheet tucked in tight.
  @tobias{code="0010" when="@withToby"}: I'm not going back in there. Nell. I'm not.
</beat>

<beat id="boiler" on="enter" target="room.boiler" once="false">
  @narrator{code="0010"}: The boiler room. Heat, rust, and the furnace door ajar like a mouth deciding what to say.
</beat>

<beat id="surgery" on="enter" target="room.surgery" once="false">
  @narrator{code="0010"}: Surgery. The operating lamp swings to follow you, very slightly, like a sunflower.
</beat>

<beat id="office" on="enter" target="room.office" once="false">
  @narrator{code="0010"}: The office. The decanter is full now. The wasp is gone.
</beat>

<beat id="gate" on="enter" target="room.gate" once="false">
  @narrator{code="0010"}: The gate. Beyond the bars, the car, the road, the whole ordinary world, lit by one sodium lamp.
  @narrator{code="0020"}: The keypad on the gatepost blinks.
</beat>
